> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">454</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἄλλοτε ἤ. πολλάκις</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">507a</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἤ. γε</span> even <b class=\"lex-tr\">now</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">19.52</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">III</span> of place, <span class=\"gk\">ἀπὸ ταύτης ἤ. Αἴγυπτος</span> after this Egypt begins, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.5</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.15</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.99</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Hipp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1200</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">Φωκεῦσιν ἤ. ὅμορος ἡ Βοιωτία ἐστίν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.95</span> </span>. (In general, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">222b7</span> </span>.)</div></div><div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἤδη2</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἤδη</span>, <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἤδης</span>, <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἤδησθα</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> v. Εἴδω. <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἥδιστος</span>, <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἡδίων</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Sup.</span> </span> and <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Comp. of</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">ἡδύς